# Wiccan, Rising Magician: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, exile another target nonland, nontoken permanent. Return
# that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step." Cast on turn 1 for {4}{U}
# paid exactly (Island and four Moxen). On turn 3 Bot1's Ornithopter, a creature spell, triggers nothing. Opt, a noncreature
# spell, does: Wiccan itself, a land (Bot1's Island) and a token (Bot2's Soldier) are not legal targets (the refusals), Bot2's
# S.H.I.E.L.D. Deployment Drone is, and is exiled. At the end step it returns under Bot2's control as a new object (CR 400.7)
# and its enters trigger makes a second Soldier.

